<title>USA: CCC amends shipment date for N. Korea corn tender.</title>
<headline>CCC amends shipment date for N. Korea corn tender.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it amended the shipment date for its May 1 tender for up to 50,000 tonnes of U.S. corn for donation to North Korea.</p>
<p>The shipment period was now slated for May 10-June 10 instead of the initial May 10-30 shipment.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
